{# The whole top bar, as one block (ticket 30).

   It exists so that the squelette and the live preview on `/admin/layout` render the *same*
   markup: the preview posts the form, gets this back rendered from what was typed, and swaps
   it in. A second "preview" template would be a drawing of the navbar that drifts from the
   navbar the first time either is touched.

   Which is also why the menu toggle is in here rather than left in the squelette -- it is
   part of the bar, so it has to survive the swap. #}
<button class="yw-btn btn-menu">{{ icon('menu-2') }}</button>
<div class="navbar-header">
  {{ brand|raw }}
</div>
{{ navbar|raw }}
{{ quickMenu|raw }}
